{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o014a","title":"刘岱杀桥瑁","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o014a-account","label":"正文","text":"刘岱因与桥瑁不和而杀之，改以王肱领东郡太守。","evidence":["wudi-e-o014a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0060","role":"杀人任官","evidence":["wudi-e-o014a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0063","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o014a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0078","role":"受任","evidence":["wudi-e-o014a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"东郡","evidence":["wudi-e-o014a-q"]},"time":{"label":"初平元年","year":190,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o014a-q","wudi-q-o009","wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde"],"chronology":"wudi-y190","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o009","basis":"初平元年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,104,"O014a"],"order":64},{"id":"wudi-e-o018b","title":"曹操破白绕并领东郡","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o018b-account","label":"正文","text":"于毒、白绕、眭固等侵掠两郡，王肱不能抵御；曹操击败白绕，袁绍表其为东郡太守。","evidence":["wudi-e-o018b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0080","role":"侵掠","evidence":["wudi-e-o018b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0081","role":"侵掠战败","evidence":["wudi-e-o018b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0082","role":"侵掠","evidence":["wudi-e-o018b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0078","role":"不能御敌","evidence":["wudi-e-o018b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"击敌领郡","evidence":["wudi-e-o018b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"表任","evidence":["wudi-e-o018b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"魏郡、东郡、濮阳、东武阳","evidence":["wudi-e-o018b-q"]},"time":{"label":"初平二年","year":191,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o018b-q","wudi-q-o016","wudi-q-b-51f98a867014d3fedddd"],"chronology":"wudi-y191","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o016","basis":"初平二年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,142,"O018b"],"order":72}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0078","name":"王肱","evidence":["wudi-q-o014"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o014-wudi-p0078","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o014"]},{"id":"wudi-m-o018-wudi-p0078","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o018"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o014a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-dc4cb1aed0af168c4564","layer":"original","quote":"刘岱与桥瑁相恶〖25〗，岱杀瑁，以王肱领东郡太守〖26〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29},{"id":"wudi-e-o018b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1692e234ab7a13fd2792","layer":"original","quote":"黑山贼于毒、白绕、眭固等十余万众略魏郡、东郡〖3〗，﹝一﹞王肱不能御。太祖引兵入东郡，击白绕于濮阳〖4〗，破之。袁绍因表太祖为东郡太守；治东武阳〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":141,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":17,"end":93},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗初平元年：公元 190 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-93d66253e23c705b336d","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"wudi-q-b-51f98a867014d3fedddd","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-51f98a867014d3fedddd","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：初平二年（公元 191）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-675465772382db7c3192","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o009","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞同时俱起兵〖2〗。众各数万，推绍为盟主。太祖行奋武将军〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130},{"id":"wudi-q-o014","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-dc4cb1aed0af168c4564","layer":"original","quote":"刘岱与桥瑁相恶〖25〗，岱杀瑁，以王肱领东郡太守〖26〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29},{"id":"wudi-q-o016","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-15ef6fb810e957089b24","layer":"original","quote":"二年春〖1〗，绍、馥遂立虞为帝，虞终不敢当。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wudi-q-o018","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1692e234ab7a13fd2792","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，袁绍胁韩馥，取冀州〖2〗。黑山贼于毒、白绕、眭固等十余万众略魏郡、东郡〖3〗，﹝一﹞王肱不能御。太祖引兵入东郡，击白绕于濮阳〖4〗，破之。袁绍因表太祖为东郡太守；治东武阳〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":141,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":93}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
